! =============================================================================
! IMBH Formation via Runaway Stellar Collisions in a Young Dense Cluster
! =============================================================================
! Physically motivated by: Vergara et al. (2025, A&A), Arca Sedda et al. (2023)
!
! Science case:
!   In ultra-dense young clusters (rh ~ 0.1-0.5 pc), the most massive stars
!   sink to the core within ~1 Myr via dynamical friction.  Repeated physical
!   collisions between these massive stars build a very massive star (VMS,
!   >1000 Msun) that can collapse into an intermediate-mass black hole (IMBH).
!   This is a leading channel for IMBH formation and a LISA GW target.
!
! Expected phenomena:
!   - Rapid mass segregation of O/B stars within 1-2 Myr
!   - Runaway stellar mergers in the core producing a VMS (>500 Msun)
!   - IMBH formation at ~3-5 Myr when the VMS collapses
!   - Subsequent IMBH-BH binary formation via exchange encounters
!   - Ejected hypervelocity stars from 3-body slingshots
!
! Setup:  N=100k, King W0=9 (very concentrated), rh~0.5 pc, Z=0.001,
!         no primordial binaries (collisional dynamics dominate),
!         Kroupa IMF up to 150 Msun, no tidal field (isolated cluster).
!         Short integration: 20 Myr (captures entire runaway phase).
!
! Compute cost:  ~6-12 hours on 16-24 cores (similar to our N=100k run).
! =============================================================================

&INNBODY6
KSTART=1,TCOMP=1.0E8,TCRTP0=43200,isernb=40,iserreg=40,iserks=0 /

&ININPUT
N=100000,NFIX=1,NCRIT=10,NRAND=73219,NNBOPT=80,NRUN=1,NCOMM=10,
ETAI=0.01,ETAR=0.01,RS0=0.08,DTADJ=0.5,DELTAT=1.0,TCRIT=20.0,QE=1.0E-02,RBAR=0.50,ZMBAR=0.7,
KZ(1:10)= 1 1 1 0 1 0 3 2 3 2
KZ(11:20)=0 1 0 0 2 0 0 0 3 6
KZ(21:30)=1 1 2 0 2 2 3 2 0 2
KZ(31:40)=1 0 2 2 1 0 1 1 2 1
KZ(41:50)=0 0 0 0 0 4 3 0 3 0 ,
DTMIN=1.0E-7,RMIN=4.E-5,ETAU=0.1,ECLOSE=1.0,GMIN=1.0E-06,GMAX=0.01,SMAX=0.5,
Level='C' /

&INSSE /

&INBSE /

&INCOLL /

&INDATA
ALPHAS=2.35,BODY1=150.0,BODYN=0.08,NBIN0=0,NHI0=0,ZMET=0.001,EPOCH0=0,DTPLOT=1.0 /

&INSETUP SEMI=,ECC=,APO=,N2=,SCALE=,ZM1=,ZM2,ZMH,RCUT= /

&INSCALE
Q=0.5,VXROT=0.0,VZROT=0.0,RTIDE=0.0 /

&INXTRNL0
GMG=0.0,RG0=0.0,DISK=,A=,B=,VCIRC=,RCIRC=,GMB=,AR=,GAM=,RG=,,,VG=,,,MP=,AP2=,MPDOT=,TDELAY= /

&INBINPOP
SEMI0=,ECC0=,RATIO=,RANGE=,NSKIP=,IDORM= /

&INHIPOP
SEMI0=,ECC0=,RATIO=,RANGE= /

